    "text": "第一次品嚐這家聲名遠播的柏林漢堡店。整體表現中規中矩，雖然個人覺得沒有想像中那麼令人驚艷，但作為柏林獨特的在地體驗，畢竟是公廁改建而成的特色漢堡店，還是相當值得來嚐鮮。下午五點左右抵達剛好不用排隊，相當順利！",
    "textTranslated": "This was my first time trying this renowned Berlin burger joint. Overall, it was decent, nothing particularly amazing. While I personally found it less than I'd hoped, as a unique Berlin experience—a burger joint converted from a public restroom—it's still definitely worth a try. Arriving around 5 PM was perfect; no queues, very smooth!"
  },
